Template: ultimate/title
Type: title
Description: Debian Ultimate: branch, init, kernel and desktop
Description-es.UTF-8: Debian Ultimate: rama, init, núcleo y escritorio

Template: ultimate/branch
Type: select
Choices-C: ${BRANCHES_C}
Choices: ${BRANCHES}
Choices-es.UTF-8: ${BRANCHES}
Default: stable
Description: Branch:
 stable installs Genuen, Devuan, Debian or LocOS, depending on the init and
 kernel chosen next.
 .
 testing installs Debian testing and unstable installs PikaOS; both use
 systemd and need an Internet connection. ${PIKANOTE}
Description-es.UTF-8: Rama:
 stable instala Genuen, Devuan, Debian o LocOS, según el init y el núcleo
 que elija a continuación.
 .
 testing instala Debian testing y unstable instala PikaOS; las dos usan
 systemd y necesitan conexión a Internet. ${PIKANOTE}

Template: ultimate/init
Type: select
Choices-C: sysvinit, openrc, systemd, runit
Choices: SysV (Default), OpenRC (Recommended), systemd, runit
Choices-es.UTF-8: SysV (Por defecto), OpenRC (Recomendado), systemd, runit
Default: sysvinit
Description: Init system:
 SysV, OpenRC and runit install Devuan (Genuen with linux-libre) from this
 disc.
 .
 systemd installs Debian stable and needs an Internet connection.
Description-es.UTF-8: Sistema de inicio (init):
 SysV, OpenRC y runit instalan Devuan (Genuen con linux-libre) desde este
 disco.
 .
 systemd instala Debian stable y necesita conexión a Internet.

Template: ultimate/kernel
Type: select
Choices-C: linux-libre, linux, linux-locos
Choices: linux-libre (Default), linux (Recommended), linux-locos (LocOS)
Choices-es.UTF-8: linux-libre (Por defecto), linux (Recomendado), linux-locos (LocOS)
Default: linux-libre
Description: Kernel:
 linux-libre is 100% free software: it will not load closed firmware or
 CPU microcode updates (no fixes for Spectre-like CPU bugs).
 .
 ${HWNOTE}
Description-es.UTF-8: Núcleo:
 linux-libre es 100% software libre: no carga firmware cerrado ni
 actualizaciones de microcódigo de la CPU (sin parches para fallos de CPU
 tipo Spectre).
 .
 ${HWNOTE}

Template: ultimate/components
Type: multiselect
Choices-C: non-free-firmware, contrib, non-free
Choices: non-free-firmware (closed firmware the kernel loads), contrib, non-free (closed software such as NVIDIA or Steam)
Choices-es.UTF-8: non-free-firmware (firmware cerrado que carga el núcleo), contrib, non-free (software cerrado como NVIDIA o Steam)
Default: non-free-firmware
Description: Repositories:
 main is always included.
 .
 Extra repositories to enable:
Description-es.UTF-8: Repositorios:
 main siempre se incluye.
 .
 Repositorios adicionales que activar:

Template: ultimate/desktop
Type: select
Choices-C: mate, xfce, cinnamon, gnome, gnome-flashback, kde, lxde, lxqt, none
Choices: MATE (Default), Xfce (Recommended), Cinnamon, GNOME, GNOME Flashback, KDE Plasma, LXDE, LXQt, None (console only)
Choices-es.UTF-8: MATE (Por defecto), Xfce (Recomendado), Cinnamon, GNOME, GNOME Flashback, KDE Plasma, LXDE, LXQt, Ninguno (solo consola)
Default: mate
Description: Desktop:
 The desktop environment to install (downloaded from the Internet).
Description-es.UTF-8: Escritorio:
 El entorno de escritorio que instalar (se descarga de Internet).

Template: ultimate/progress
Type: text
Description: Installing the ${KERNEL} kernel...
Description-es.UTF-8: Instalando el núcleo ${KERNEL}...
